  values ('2026-10-30', $c$scheduled-task-persistence$c$, $c$The Updater That Isn't$c$, $c$windows_logs$c$, 2, $c$During a follow-up hunt on a host that was cleaned last week, you find this event.$c$, $c$EventID:      4698 (A scheduled task was created)
